Bundled Fonts — Attribution & Licensing
========================================

This package (Inkspan / @contextualwisdomlab/cwl-editor) bundles the following
web fonts so the editor renders Korean, English, Japanese, Chinese (Simplified
and Traditional) and Vietnamese fully offline (air-gapped / 폐쇄망), with no
network fetch and no proprietary/copyleft licensing.

All bundled fonts are from the Noto Sans family and are licensed under the
SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (OFL-1.1). The full license text is in
this directory: OFL.txt.

Fonts bundled (woff2, subset by unicode-range, in ./files/):

  Font family      Script coverage                         Weights   Source
  ---------------  --------------------------------------  --------  -------------------------
  Noto Sans        Latin, Latin-ext, Vietnamese, Cyrillic  400, 700  https://fonts.google.com/noto/specimen/Noto+Sans
  Noto Sans KR     Korean (Hangul)                         400       https://fonts.google.com/noto/specimen/Noto+Sans+KR
  Noto Sans JP     Japanese (Kana + Kanji)                 400       https://fonts.google.com/noto/specimen/Noto+Sans+JP
  Noto Sans SC     Chinese, Simplified                     400       https://fonts.google.com/noto/specimen/Noto+Sans+SC
  Noto Sans TC     Chinese, Traditional                    400       https://fonts.google.com/noto/specimen/Noto+Sans+TC

Copyright: The Noto Project Authors (https://github.com/notofonts),
with Reserved Font Name "Noto".

The woff2 subset files were produced from the Google Fonts distribution of the
above families (each split by unicode-range) via scripts/fetch-fonts.mjs. Only
the font bytes and the generated @font-face CSS are redistributed; no font was
modified. Redistribution of these fonts under OFL-1.1 is permitted, including
bundling with software.

